  "duration": 93.599625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.82,
      "text": "This infographic breaks down the two primary categories of artificial intelligence."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.38,
      "end": 11.88,
      "text": "We've talked about recommendation AI, but now let's turn our attention to the second category, generative AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.16,
      "end": 19.2,
      "text": "Instead of just picking from a list of options that are already out there, generative AI has a completely different job."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.6,
      "end": 21.78,
      "text": "It makes things that didn't exist before."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.4,
      "end": 29.64,
      "text": "It's a leap from a system that curates your movie choices to a system that actually builds a completely original piece of work from scratch."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.9,
      "end": 34.48,
      "text": "The engine behind this creation process is something called a prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.98,
      "end": 39.02,
      "text": "That's simply the specific question or set of instructions you type into the system."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.8,
      "end": 46.94,
      "text": "By interpreting what you ask for, the AI can immediately draft written content, like a professional email or a full-length essay."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.46,
      "end": 54.16,
      "text": "It can also generate custom visuals, sketching out detailed images or even structuring the code for a brand new website."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.02,
      "end": 60.62,
      "text": "And the outputs extend into complex media, too, allowing you to produce original songs and video clips."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.36,
      "end": 68.38,
      "text": "All of these entirely distinct forms of media are generated through the same simple action of feeding instructions into the prompt box."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.04,
      "end": 73.52,
      "text": "To put it simply, standard AI recommends, while generative AI creates,"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.01,
      "end": 77.9,
      "text": "and it is that ability to create that serves as the focus of this course."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.74,
      "end": 83.2,
      "text": "Remember, you now have access to a highly capable tool designed to help you get things done."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.8,
      "end": 87.2,
      "text": "The best way to learn is to start with something you want to do."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.7,
      "end": 90.02,
      "text": "Type in your first prompt and see what you can build."
    }
  ],
